border-white/10 p-10 rounded-3xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center hover:bg-white/[0.08] transition-colors\">\n          <span class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter italic mb-2\">Paris-Grade</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] opacity-40\">Heritage Craftsmanship</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-[#161617] border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-3xl group hover:border-[#E2D1C3]/40 transition-all duration-500\">\n          <p class=\"text-xl font-light italic leading-snug mb-10 text-[#F4F4F9]/90\">\n            \"A brand that understands luxury is about how you feel in your skin. Nectar is dismantling barriers while maintaining an elite aesthetic.\"\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_004_url\" alt=\"Amara Okafor\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-sm\">Amara Okafor</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E2D1C3]/60\">Founder, New Thread Initiative</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1B] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center\">\n             <span class=\"block text-xl font-bold\">98%</span>\n             <span class=\"text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\">Sentiment</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1B] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center\">\n             <span class=\"block text-xl font-bold\">4.9/5</span>\n             <span class=\"text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\">Review Score</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
